          </span>
          <span class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <span class="block text-sm font-semibold text-text-primary">Add older reports or history: drop them here, or tap to choose</span>
            <span class="mt-0.5 block text-xs leading-relaxed text-text-tertiary">A PDF, a photo of the report as JPG, PNG or WebP, the JSON your Verve app exports, or a CSV of workouts from Garmin, Strava or a spreadsheet (date, sport, minutes, average heart rate) &middot; up to 15 MB each &middot; several at once &middot; originals stay in your private archive &middot; a file you already have is spotted before it is filed</span>
          </span>
          <span class="hidden shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-accent/40 bg-accent/10 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-accent-light sm:inline-block">Choose files</span>
          <input id="file" type="file" accept="application/pdf,image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/heic,image/heif,application/json,.json,text/csv,.csv" multiple class="hidden" />
        </label>

        <!-- who pays for what: shown once the plans are open -->
        <section id="whopays" class="mt-6 hidden max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-accent/40 bg-accent/[0.06] p-4">
          <div class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest text-accent-light">WHO PAYS FOR WHAT</div>
          <dl class="mt-2 grid gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-text-secondary sm:grid-cols-[88px_1fr]">
            <dt class="font-bold text-text-primary">Free</dt><dd>Two reports read. The app's export and a CSV are not imported: a look, nothing kept from before.</dd>
            <dt class="font-bold text-text-primary">Pro</dt><dd>Exports and CSVs imported, every year kept, In depth on your own page. The athlete's plan.</dd>
